 26	- A function-valued `ToolDefinitionSource` resolves its definition on each `execute` call and validates against the `inputSchema` returned for that call, caching compiled validators by schema object reference (`WeakMap`) so distinct returned schemas each enforce their own rules ([validated by: uses the current schema from a function-valued definition source](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.test.ts#L94)).
